00:56:17.980 --> 00:56:19.700
And some, and, and add some variety.

00:56:19.880 --> 00:56:25.340
So it's interesting that like, after you complete the boss one, you haven't even seen all the

00:56:25.340 --> 00:56:30.580
possible stages, uh, all the different layouts of objectives, but also that like, they're going

00:56:30.580 --> 00:56:35.800
to repeat objectives, but make sure that they, uh, change the scenery and make them a little

00:56:35.800 --> 00:56:39.160
tougher and add extra obstacles and stuff.

